        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#252c4a,#171e37 75%);color:#eef1ff;padding:6cqw;border:1px solid #8b7aac;border-radius:2cqw;font-family:system-ui,Arial,sans-serif'><div style='font:800 2.9cqw/1.3 system-ui;letter-spacing:.15em;color:#e0c77e;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4cqw'>01 / COMPANY</div><h2 style='font:700 7.1cqw/1.1 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 5cqw'>Twilite LLC</h2><div style='font:400 4.35cqw/1.55 system-ui;color:#d4d9ed;display:grid;gap:3.3cqw'><p style='margin:0'>Founded in Louisiana in May 2026, Twilite LLC develops software for people who want to create, organize and keep connected work.</p><p style='margin:0'>The company builds the environment. The user owns the direction.</p></div></div>"
        },
        "sourceMarkdown": "# Twilite LLC\n\nFounded in Louisiana in May 2026, Twilite LLC develops software for people who want to create, organize and keep connected work.\n\nThe company builds the environment. The user owns the direction.",
